000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID.    ACCTPOST.
000300 AUTHOR.       R HALVORSEN.
000400 INSTALLATION. CENTRAL DATA PROCESSING.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN. 03/14/89.
000600*------------------------------------------------------------
000700* ACCTPOST - APPLY THE DAY'S TRANSACTIONS TO THE ACCOUNT MASTER.
000800* BATCH. RUN BY JOB ACCTDLY THROUGH PROC ACCTPRC.
000900* THE MAIN LINE STARTS RIGHT AFTER THE PROCEDURE DIVISION
001000* HEADER (NO PARAGRAPH NAME), AS THIS SHOP'S OLDER PROGRAMS DO.
001100*------------------------------------------------------------
001200 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001300 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001400 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-ZOS.
001500 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-ZOS.
001600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001700 FILE-CONTROL.
001800     SELECT TRAN-FILE ASSIGN TO TRANIN
001900         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002000         FILE STATUS IS WS-TRAN-STATUS.
002100     SELECT ACCT-OUT ASSIGN TO ACCTOUT
002200         ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002300         FILE STATUS IS WS-ACCT-STATUS.
002400 DATA DIVISION.
002500 FILE SECTION.
002600 FD  TRAN-FILE
002700     RECORDING MODE IS F.
002800 01  TRAN-RECORD.
002900     COPY TRANREC.
003000 FD  ACCT-OUT
003100     RECORDING MODE IS F.
003200 01  ACCT-OUT-REC.
003300     COPY ACCTREC.
003400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003500 01  WS-FLAGS.
003600     05  WS-EOF-FLAG            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
003700         88  WS-EOF                 VALUE 'Y'.
003800     05  WS-TRAN-STATUS         PIC X(2).
003900     05  WS-ACCT-STATUS         PIC X(2).
004000 01  WS-COUNTERS.
004100     05  WS-READ-CNT            PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004200     05  WS-POST-CNT            PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004300     05  WS-REJ-CNT             PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004400 01  WS-DATE-AREA.
004500     COPY DATEWS.
004600 01  WS-ACCOUNT.
004700     COPY ACCTREC.
004800 01  WS-DATE-PGM            PIC X(8) VALUE 'DATEUTIL'.
004900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
005000     OPEN INPUT  TRAN-FILE
005100          OUTPUT ACCT-OUT
005200     PERFORM 1000-INITIALIZE THRU 1000-EXIT
005300     PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-TRAN THRU 2000-EXIT UNTIL WS-EOF
005400     PERFORM 9000-TERMINATE
005500     GOBACK.
005600 1000-INITIALIZE.
005700     INITIALIZE WS-COUNTERS WS-ACCOUNT
005800     CALL WS-DATE-PGM USING WS-DATE-AREA
005900     PERFORM 8000-READ-TRAN.
006000 1000-EXIT.
006100     EXIT.
006200 2000-PROCESS-TRAN.
006300     IF TRAN-DEBIT
006400        PERFORM 2100-POST-DEBIT
006500     ELSE
006600        PERFORM 2200-POST-CREDIT
006700     END-IF
006800     ADD 1 TO WS-POST-CNT
006900     PERFORM 8000-READ-TRAN.
007000 2000-EXIT.
007100     EXIT.
007200 2100-POST-DEBIT.
007300     SUBTRACT TRAN-AMOUNT FROM ACCT-BALANCE OF WS-ACCOUNT
007400     IF ACCT-BALANCE OF WS-ACCOUNT < ZERO
007500        PERFORM 2900-REJECT
007600     END-IF.
007700 2200-POST-CREDIT.
007800     ADD TRAN-AMOUNT TO ACCT-BALANCE OF WS-ACCOUNT.
007900 2900-REJECT.                                                     CHG0233
008000     ADD 1 TO WS-REJ-CNT                                          CHG0233
008100     DISPLAY 'ACCTPOST REJECT ' TRAN-ACCT-ID.                     CHG0233
008200 8000-READ-TRAN.
008300     READ TRAN-FILE
008400        AT END
008500           SET WS-EOF TO TRUE
008600        NOT AT END
008700           ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT
008800     END-READ.
008900 9000-TERMINATE.                                                  CHG0412
009000     WRITE ACCT-OUT-REC FROM WS-ACCOUNT                           CHG0412
009100     CLOSE TRAN-FILE ACCT-OUT                                     CHG0412
009200     DISPLAY 'ACCTPOST READ    ' WS-READ-CNT                      CHG0412
009300     DISPLAY 'ACCTPOST POSTED  ' WS-POST-CNT                      CHG0412
009400     DISPLAY 'ACCTPOST REJECTS ' WS-REJ-CNT.                      CHG0412
